00:21:57.070 --> 00:21:57.880
Jirachi!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:58.680
Chobomaki!

00:21:58.680 --> 00:21:59.450
Kibago!

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:00.220
Gonbe!

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:01.000
Bayleaf!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.500
Freezer!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.690
Zacian!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.540
Mew!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:21.370
Wooper!

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:22.090
Pachirisu!

00:22:22.090 --> 00:22:22.940
Sunaba!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:23.600
Absol!

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:24.460
Lunala!

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:25.270
Rabbifoot!

00:22:25.270 --> 00:22:26.050
Tropius!

00:22:26.050 --> 00:22:26.820
Sunahebi!

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:27.690
Vibrava!

00:22:27.690 --> 00:22:28.340
Burshamo!

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:29.110
Mokuroh!

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:29.930
Rotom!

00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:30.650
Mooland!

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:31.430
