00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:35.310
Darkrai!

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:35.990
Iwanko!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:36.820
Cortoise!

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:37.650
Scorupi!

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:38.430
Pippi!

