Kunugidama!

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:40.670
Mankey!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:41.480
Kimori!

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:42.300
Ligray!

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:43.730
Rayquaza!

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:44.460
Zamazenta!

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:05.490
(Mew → Zamazenta Ver.)

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:09.640
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:10.870
Go!

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:16.520
I’d really like you
to meet Alolan Nasshi!

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:17.990
Alolan Nasshi?

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:20.210
